    "text": "Hu se man sceal swerie.\nOn \u00f0one Drihten, \u00fee \u00f0es haligdom is fore halig, ic wille beon N hold & getriwe & eal lufian \u00f0\u00e6t he lufa\u00f0\nOn \u00f0one Drihten, \u00fee \u00f0es haligdom is fore halig, swa ic sp\u00e6ce drife mid fullan folcrihte, butan br\u00e6de &\nOn \u00f0one Drihten, n\u00e6s ic \u00e6t r\u00e6de ne \u00e6t d\u00e6de, ne gewita ne gewyrhta, \u00f0\u00e6r man mid unrihte N orf\nAc swa ic orf h\u00e6bbe, swa ic hit mid rihte begeat.\n& swa ic hit tyme, swa hit me se sealde, \u00f0e ic hit nu on hand sette.\n& swa ic orf h\u00e6bbe, swa hit me se sealde, \u00f0e hit to syllanne agte.\n& swa ic orf h\u00e6bbe, swa hit of minum agnum \u00f0ingum com, & swa hit on folcriht min agen \u00e6ht is &\nOn \u00f0one Drihten, ne teo ic N ne for hete ne for hole ne for unrihtre feohgyrnesse, ne ic nan so\u00f0re nat,\nOn \u00f0one Drihten, ic eom unscyldig \u00e6g\u00f0er ge d\u00e6de ge dihtes \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re tihtlan, \u00f0e N me tih\u00f0.\nOn \u00f0one Drihten, se a\u00f0 is cl\u00e6ne & unm\u00e6ne, \u00f0e N swor.\nOn \u00e6lmihtiges Godes naman, \u00f0u me behete hal & cl\u00e6ne \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u me sealdest, & fulle ware wi\u00f0\nOn \u00e6lmihtiges Godes naman, swa ic her N on so\u00f0re gewitnesse stande, unabeden & ungeboht to, swa ic\nOn \u00e6lmihtiges Godes naman, nyste ic on \u00f0am \u00f0ingum, \u00fee \u00feu ymbe specst, ful ne facn, ne wac ne wom,\nOn lifiendes Godes naman, swa ic feos bidde, swa ic gywanan h\u00e6bbe \u00f0\u00e6s, \u00fee me N behet, \u00f0a ic him\nOn lifiendes Godes naman, ne \u00f0earf ic N sceatt ne scylling, ne penig ne peniges weor\u00f0, ac eal ic him",
